  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A car accelerates uniformly from rest to a velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> during time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t_{1}\"></span>. It then continues at constant velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t_{1}\"></span> to time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t_{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the total distance covered by the car in <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t_{2}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v t_{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}vt_{2}-t_{1}+v t_{1}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}vt_{2}+t_{1}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}v t_{1}+vt_{2}-t_{1}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
